    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4419388145664
    m_Localized: "Bos desired to win at sporting events. \r\nHe thought it would
      be easy to compete with the Antelope brothers. \r\nAs soon as the bell rang,
      Bos rushed out of the classroom.  \r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4562472632320
    m_Localized: "Isbert, Jimmie, and Orange were baffled by Bos\u2019s behavior."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5581906608128
    m_Localized: Can you guess why Bos rushed out of the classroom as soon as the
      bell rang?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6171332149248
    m_Localized: Incorrect! Please try again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6570009133056
    m_Localized: To buy fish balls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6667837079552
    m_Localized: To study at home
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860494045184
    m_Localized: To practice long jump
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7371695816704
    m_Localized: You are correct!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8348817653760
    m_Localized: How do Isbert, Jimmie, and Orange feel about Bos' behavior?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8538433748992
    m_Localized: Incorrect! Please try again!
    m_Metadata:
