    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9400157700096
    m_Localized: "Isbert set up the railing to practice the high jump. \r\nOrange
      practiced running laps on the track.\r\nJimmie practiced a cheering dance.
      \r\nThey found out that Bos was not there.\r\nAt this moment, a strange sound
      came from the rooftop. \r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9548447318016
    m_Localized: "Bos put a large rock on his feet to make the jumping exercise more
      challenging.\r\nEach jump made a loud noise. \r\nIsbert, Orange, and Jimmie
      heard the sound and walked to the rooftop. \r\nThey saw Bos was devoted to
      the exercise, so they did not want to disturb him from practice. \r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9942154051584
    m_Localized: What is Isbert practicing?
