    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16896914063360
    m_Localized: "\u5EE3\u64AD\u4E2D\u50B3\u4F86\u8001\u5E2B\u7684\u547C\u53EB\uFF0C\u53EC\u96C6\u53C3\u8207\u8DD1\u6B65\u7684\u9078\u624B\u6E96\u5099\u3002\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17589821472768
    m_Localized: "The stadium was filled with cheers. \r\nA flock of birds flew in
      a V-formation over the sports field to kick off the games.\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17717353480192
    m_Localized: "\u201CRunners get ready!\u201D a teacher called through the radio.  "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18418586583040
    m_Localized: Do you remember who participated in the run?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18480809082880
    m_Localized: Incorrect! Please try again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18557124444160
    m_Localized: Isbert
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18638493941760
    m_Localized: Orange
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18711739072512
    m_Localized: Bos
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18780861202432
    m_Localized: You are correct!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19020544704512
    m_Localized: How do you think Orange felt when preparing for the competition?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19107849142272
    m_Localized: Incorrect! Please try again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19180100222976
    m_Localized: nervous
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19230595448832
    m_Localized: angry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19305174368256
    m_Localized: sad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19360950222848
    m_Localized: You are correct!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20442594115584
    m_Localized: "Orange looked very excited. \r\nAs soon as the horn sounded, Orange
      ran forward as hard as she could. \r\nJimmie cheered her on in the stadium
      auditorium.\r\nFinally, Orange won third place successfully.  \r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20796857614336
    m_Localized: "Isbert was getting ready for the high jump competition. \r\nEveryone
      in the auditorium focused on Isbert.\r\nIsbert jumped hard and managed to jump
      the highest record. \r\nEveryone cheered for him. \r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21353370451968
    m_Localized: What is Jimmie doing in the stands?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21453874364416
    m_Localized: Incorrect! Please try again!
