    m_Localized: You are correct!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48686022230016
    m_Localized: Bos felt pressure when he saw that his two friends had won awards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48839332429824
    m_Localized: "The in-course broadcast announced the final call for the long jump
      event. \r\nBos felt nervous, and his skin was covered with a cold sweat. \r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49138759598080
    m_Localized: How did Bos feel when he saw his two friends win awards?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49207919476736
    m_Localized: Incorrect! Please try again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
