    m_Localized: He felt hungry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50878355570688
    m_Localized: He feared he can't win the game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53751281844224
    m_Localized: felt that no one liked him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55163071987712
    m_Localized: You are correct!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55655042875392
    m_Localized: "Bos ran hard to the sand to win a medal. \r\nHe focused on the
      sand when he jumped. \r\nAt that moment, the world goes silent. \r\n\nHe lifts
      clouds of sand and dust when jumping.\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56629786542080
    m_Localized: "Bos stared at the scoreboard, which showed that he was in second
      place, a 0.2-meter difference from the best score. \r\nHe shouted with joy,
      thinking that he must get the award. \r\nHowever, the Antelope brothers broke
      the record.\r\nUnluckily, Bos dropped out of the top three.\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57048520687616
    m_Localized: 'Isbert and Orange took photos together and were so happy to get
      the award. However, Bos left the sports ground angrily as he was upset.

      Isbert,
      Jimmie, and Orange did not notice that Bos had left.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57263445213184
    m_Localized: What were Bos' feelings when he looked at his results after jumping?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
