  - m_Id: 3233235233374208
    m_Localized: In the main menu, you can select the book you want to read from
      the catalog.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3233607993753600
    m_Localized: When you are on an ebook page, you can use the left and right buttons
      to browse books.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3234041017892864
    m_Localized: The book includes interactive elements, including multiple-choice
      questions and scenarios of interaction between parents and children.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3234171884371968
    m_Localized: You can also use the bookmark button to bookmark pages so that when
      you return to the book later, you can start reading from the page you bookmarked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
