  - m_Id: 3251055161737216
    m_Localized: Character introduction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3251487409930240
    m_Localized: 'Bos is an elephant who can tell right from wrong. Also, he has
      a down-to-earth attitude towards work. His body will change to different colors
      when he feels different emotions. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3251655383416832
    m_Localized: "Orange is a penguin with orange hair. She is energetic and likes
      to make friends. \r\nAlso, she is very kind. However, she is impatient and
      cannot sit still in class. \r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3251868084961280
    m_Localized: 'Jimmie is a hedgehog with round glasses. His hair is generally
      round and furry. Although he is introverted and shy, he is cautious and patient.
      When frightened, he contracted his body into a ball and rolled on the ground. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3251977149448192
    m_Localized: 'Isbert is a giraffe who is introverted and considerate. His hobby
      is collecting stickers and putting them on his body. Also, he can stay calm
      and use different ways to relieve stress when encountering difficulties.  '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
